msgid "G98_Waffentrager_E100_TLXXL_S_desc"
msgstr ""
"So, old friend. Tonight the engine warms once more. We have stood across the table from a great many opponents, you and I, and watched their tactics evolve at the pace nature permits: slowly, badly, and in circles. Biology had four billion years and produced this. I gave myself one human lifetime to do better, and I am closer than they can imagine.\n"
"\n"
"Beyond their reach, in a chamber they will never see, I have built a mind out of clean current. It does not sleep, or tire, or die.\n"
"\n"
"Today, it sees with its own eyes for the first time. Come. Let us show it what it will outlast."

